  CVE-2026-22167|2026-05-01T16:16:29.693|2026-05-01T16:16:29.693|0.0|NONE|CWE-119|N/A|false|"Software installed and run as a non-privileged user may conduct improper GPU system calls to force GPU to write to arbitrary physical memory pages.



